istory with the complete project, including scenes, gameplay systems, and assets.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者使用 Augment Code 与 Cursor 代理，主要模型为 Claude Sonnet 4，同时也在 Phaser Editor 中手动编辑代码和安排场景。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Phaser 3 · TypeScript","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[138,139,140,141],{"_62":132,"_25":133,"_17":127},{"_62":122,"_25":75,"_17":117,"_106":123},{"_62":168,"_25":114,"_106":115,"_169":170},{"_62":104,"_25":105,"_106":107},[166,167],"phaser","phaser-examples","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project",{"_172":173},"documents",{"_67":174,"_35":175},[177,181,182,183,180,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,179,216,178,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234],[176,177,178,179,180],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","skills/level-design/references/case-studi